{"text":"I asked him if he worked in the airport, and he said, yeah, sort of. He said he was a Hare Krishna. What a beautiful world it was when you could still get lost in an airport, when zinc plates sharp as meat cleavers filled your carrions, when Hare Krishna's those dancing, chanting members of a religious sect roamed freely from gate to gate. I was terrified. But of what? That he'd kidnap me and make me a vegetarian? I was already a vegetarian. I had to keep walking with him because he had my typewriter, and I was in love with my typewriter.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.76},{"text":"asked","start":0.76,"end":0.96},{"text":"him","start":0.96,"end":1.14},{"text":"if","start":1.14,"end":1.24},{"text":"he","start":1.24,"end":1.36},{"text":"worked","start":1.36,"end":1.56},{"text":"in","start":1.56,"end":1.72},{"text":"the","start":1.72,"end":1.84},{"text":"airport","start":1.84,"end":2.2,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":2.4,"end":2.56},{"text":"he","start":2.56,"end":3.08},{"text":"said","start":3.08,"end":3.24,"punct":","},{"text":"yeah","start":3.46,"end":3.52,"punct":","},{"text":"sort","start":3.76,"end":3.9},{"text":"of","start":3.9,"end":4.14,"punct":"."},{"text":"He","start":4.36,"end":4.38},{"text":"said","start":4.38,"end":4.6},{"text":"he","start":4.6,"end":4.92},{"text":"was","start":4.92,"end":5.14},{"text":"a","start":5.14,"end":5.28},{"text":"Hare","start":5.28,"end":5.4},{"text":"Krishna","start":5.4,"end":5.78,"punct":"."},{"text":"What","start":12.66,"end":13.16},{"text":"a","start":13.16,"end":13.4},{"text":"beautiful","start":13.4,"end":14.32},{"text":"world","start":14.32,"end":14.98},{"text":"it","start":14.98,"end":15.78},{"text":"was","start":15.78,"end":16.5},{"text":"when","start":16.5,"end":17.7},{"text":"you","start":17.7,"end":17.86},{"text":"could","start":17.86,"end":18.04},{"text":"still","start":18.04,"end":18.3},{"text":"get","start":18.3,"end":18.48},{"text":"lost","start":18.48,"end":18.86},{"text":"in","start":18.